if quadrants.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/35/code.py:467:    raise AssertionError(\"failed to split motif occupancy across quadrants\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/35/code.py:471:    \"\"\"Split the five matching motifs across the two visible motif quadrants.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/1190e5a7.py:20:    - The input has a non-black background crossed by full-row and full-column bars of another color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/11/code.py:89:    - For each frame color C, inspect all sprites of color C and count the total number of enclosed 4-connected holes across them.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/6855a6e4.py:16:    Mirror gray objects across their nearest red frame so the reflected copies land inside the frames.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/6855a6e4.py:26:    - Reflect each gray object across the center line of its closest frame and redraw the frame.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/6855a6e4.py:91:        # When objects are aligned vertically (same column), we mirror across a horizontal line (mirror_r).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/6855a6e4.py:92:        # When objects are aligned horizontally (same row), we mirror across a vertical line (mirror_c).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/21/code.py:42:#    - Across examples, humans can see that a singleton shares color with a wall\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/21/code.py:49:#      even though one colored trail may cross another sprite's fill fan.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/898e7135/18/code.py:30:#      This avoids ambiguous reuse of the same shape while still leaving enough evidence across pieces.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/898e7135/18/code.py:57:#    - Across 2-4 examples a human can see that the outside shapes are enlarged copies of the inside\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/27/code.py:14:#    switch to the 