reated by those copies recursively trigger later sprite templates.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/19/code.py:45:#    - Top sprites never overlap. Inside bars, objects may touch across a bar boundary\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/19/code.py:50:#      color becomes the target fill. This is visible across multiple samples.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/291dc1e1/21/code.py:76:# - Across a few examples, humans can see that colored single pixels on the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/33/code.py:61:#    - The repeated type across different quadrants gives local evidence that color chooses the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:23:#      若那格仍被挡，再退到 `(15,10)`。原题在这种 central cross-axis 情况下通常不会走到第三、四层。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:106:    \"\"\"Reflect across the offset diagonal r = c + 1.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:116:def _crosses_axis(start: int, end: int, lo: int, n: int) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:210:    Restore the rectangle hidden by the solid marker using a fixed four-step backup chain on a cross-axis placement.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:223:    The cross-axis marker deliberately blocks shallow mirror partners, so the hidden patch is recoverable only by following the same priority ladder everywhere rather than by treating the reflection orbit as an unordered set.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:230:    assert _crosses_axis(r0, r1, lo, n) or _crosses_axis(c0, c1, lo, n)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:290:    cross_h = _crosses_axis(r0, r1, _LO, _N)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:291:    cross_v = _crosses_axis(c0, c1, _LO, _N)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:292:    if cross_h and cross_v:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/c